6th OCTOBER 1984 BATTERSEA PARK SOUTHERN YOUNGER AGE GROUP CHAMPS

With this event on our home ground it would have been a good show to have turned out in force, but disaster struck with an unfortunate mix up in times and of those that did turn up most missed their event.

Girls 2½kms: 7.C.Christou 18.46; 8.S.Barker 18.59; Intermediate Ladies 5kms: 4.G.Porter 28.50;

20th OCTOBER 1984 STEYNING NATIONAL YOUNGER AGE GROUPS CHAMPIONSHIPS

It is and always has been one of our problems being able to turn out teams in these age championships. This year we had a better chance than normal being as the races were in the south, but despite having entered teams in some of the groups only enough turned out for the Girls 2½kms for a team to start. Our best performances came from Rachael Parrott in the Girls 2½kms and Gail Porter in the Intermediate 5kms.

